n":{"start":{"line":44,"column":1,"offset":1231},"end":{"line":52,"column":4,"offset":1359}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-1"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"注意","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":3,"offset":1365},"end":{"line":54,"column":5,"offset":1367}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1363},"end":{"line":54,"column":7,"offset":1369}}},{"type":"text","value":"：請記得將程序 ID 更改為 ","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":7,"offset":1369},"end":{"line":54,"column":22,"offset":1384}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":22,"offset":1384},"end":{"line":54,"column":68,"offset":1430}}},{"type":"text","value":"，因為我們在後台使用它來測試你的程序。","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":68,"offset":1430},"end":{"line":54,"column":87,"offset":1449}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1363},"end":{"line":54,"column":87,"offset":1449}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lib.rs","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1453},"end":{"line":56,"column":9,"offset":1461}}},{"type":"text","value":" 中的入口點與我們在 ","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":9,"offset":1461},"end":{"line":56,"column":20,"offset":1472}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"/zh-HK/courses/introduction-to-pinocchio","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pinocchio 入門課程","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":21,"offset":1473},"end":{"line":56,"column":35,"offset":1487}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":20,"offset":1472},"end":{"line":56,"column":78,"offset":1530}}},{"type":"text","value":" 中介紹的非常相似。","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":78,"offset":1530},"end":{"line":56,"column":88,"offset":1540}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1453},"end":{"line":56,"column":88,"offset":1540}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"pub mod instructions;\r\nuse instructions::*;\r\n\r\nuse pinocchio::{\r\n    account_info::AccountInfo, program_entrypoint, program_error::ProgramError,\r\n    pubkey::Pubkey, ProgramResult,\r\n};\r\n\r\nprogram_entrypoint!(process_instruction);\r\n\r\n// 22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222\r\npub const ID: Pubkey = [\r\n    0x0f, 0x1e, 0x6b, 0x14, 0x21, 0xc0, 0x4a, 0x07, \r\n    0x04, 0x31, 0x26, 0x5c, 0x19, 0xc5, 0xbb, 0xee, \r\n    0x19, 0x92, 0xba, 0xe8, 0xaf, 0xd1, 0xcd, 0x07, \r\n    0x8e, 0xf8, 0xaf, 0x70, 0x47, 0xdc, 0x11, 0xf7, \r\n];\r\n\r\nfn process_instruction(\r\n    _program_id: &Pubkey,\r\n    accounts: &[AccountInfo],\r\n    instruction_data: &[u8],\r\n) -> ProgramResult {    \r\n    match instruction_data.split_first() {\r\n        Some((OpenVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => OpenVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((SplitVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => SplitVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((CloseVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => CloseVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        _ => Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData)\r\n    }\r\n}","position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1,"offset":1544},"end":{"line":89,"column":4,"offset":2642}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-2"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"我們不需要為此設置任何狀態，因此我們將直接進入創建指令的部分。","position":{"start":{"line":91,"column":1,"offset":2646},"end":{"line":91,"column":32,"offset":2677}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":91,"column":1,"offset":2646},"end":{"line":91,"column":32,"offset":2677}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":91,"column":32,"offset":2677}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 量子保險庫\r\n\r\n![Pinocchio 量子保險庫挑戰](/graphics/challenge-banners/pinocchio-quantum-vault.png)\r\n\r\n保險庫是去中心化金融（DeFi）中的一個基本構建模塊，為用戶提供安全存儲資產的方式。\r\n\r\n在這個挑戰中，我們將構建一個使用 Winternitz 簽名進行交易驗證的保險庫。這特別有趣，因為 Winternitz 簽名是第一個在 Solana 上集成的後量子簽名。\r\n\r\n> 如果你不熟悉 Winternitz 簽名，請先閱讀 [Solana 上的 Winternitz 簽名](/zh-HK/courses/winternitz-signatures-on-solana) 以了解核心概念和基礎加密技術。\r\n\r\n在這個挑戰中，我們將更新我們在 [Pinocchio 保險庫挑戰](/zh-HK/challenges/pinocchio-vault) 中構建的簡單 Lamport 保險庫，以允許使用 Winternitz 簽名作為交易驗證方法。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"安裝\" id=\"installation\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n在開始之前，請確保已安裝 Rust 和 Pinocchio。然後，在終端中運行以下命令：\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# create workspace\r\ncargo new Kiloshift-pinocchio-quantum-vault --lib --edition 2021\r\ncd Kiloshift-pinocchio-quantum-vault\r\n```\r\n\r\n添加 `pinocchio`、`pinocchio-system`、`solana-nostd-sha256` 和 `solana-winternitz`：\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncargo add pinocchio pinocchio-system solana-nostd-sha256 solana-winternitz\r\n```\r\n\r\n在 `Cargo.toml` 中聲明 crate 類型，以在 `target/deploy` 中生成部署工件：\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[lib]\r\ncrate-type = [\"lib\", \"cdylib\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\n現在你已準備好編寫你的量子保險庫程序。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"模板\" id=\"template\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n這次，我們將把程序分成小而專注的模塊，而不是將所有內容放在 `lib.rs` 中。文件夾結構大致如下：\r\n\r\n```\r\nsrc\r\n├── instructions\r\n│       ├── close.rs\r\n│       ├── open.rs\r\n│       ├── mod.rs\r\n│       └── split.rs\r\n└── lib.rs\r\n```\r\n\r\n**注意**：請記得將程序 ID 更改為 `22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222`，因為我們在後台使用它來測試你的程序。\r\n\r\n`lib.rs` 中的入口點與我們在 [Pinocchio 入門課程](/zh-HK/courses/introduction-to-pinocchio) 中介紹的非常相似。\r\n\r\n```rust\r\npub mod instructions;\r\nuse instructions::*;\r\n\r\nuse pinocchio::{\r\n    account_info::AccountInfo, program_entrypoint, program_error::ProgramError,\r\n    pubkey::Pubkey, ProgramResult,\r\n};\r\n\r\nprogram_entrypoint!(process_instruction);\r\n\r\n// 22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222\r\npub const ID: Pubkey = [\r\n    0x0f, 0x1e, 0x6b, 0x14, 0x21, 0xc0, 0x4a, 0x07, \r\n    0x04, 0x31, 0x26, 0x5c, 0x19, 0xc5, 0xbb, 0xee, \r\n    0x19, 0x92, 0xba, 0xe8, 0xaf, 0xd1, 0xcd, 0x07, \r\n    0x8e, 0xf8, 0xaf, 0x70, 0x47, 0xdc, 0x11, 0xf7, \r\n];\r\n\r\nfn process_instruction(\r\n    _program_id: &Pubkey,\r\n    accounts: &[AccountInfo],\r\n    instruction_data: &[u8],\r\n) -> ProgramResult {    \r\n    match instruction_data.split_first() {\r\n        Some((OpenVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => OpenVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((SplitVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => SplitVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((CloseVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => CloseVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        _ => Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData)\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n我們不需要為此設置任何狀態，因此我們將直接進入創建指令的部分。","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"toml","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"["}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"lib"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"crate-type"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" ="}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" ["}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#E7EE98"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"lib"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"childr